Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.86,0:00:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You're telling me to hide a\Nmirror inside the wedding cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.84,0:00:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.75,0:00:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a cool way to\Nmake an entrance or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.02,0:00:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be like bam, and I come\Nflying out of that huge cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.70,0:00:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be so funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.12,0:00:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.84,0:00:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you I don't need to be funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.26,0:00:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Now listen to me, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.94,0:00:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You got one job.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.24,0:00:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.70,0:00:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You want me to break the picture, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.42,0:00:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can do that and\Nhave a cool entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.78,0:00:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be as good as dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.98,0:00:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You think it's wise to\Ndestroy Mama's wedding cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.02,0:00:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know how much\Nshe's been looking forward
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.10,0:00:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,to it and how angry she'll\Nbe when that happens?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.46,0:00:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You made copies of my friends\Nback in the woods, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.72,0:00:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.84,0:00:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,First, she captures someone's\Nreflection in a mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.70,0:00:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Then she projects it onto an\Nanimal and transforms them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.28,0:01:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I can do that, so what?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.64,0:01:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I captured all of these, so\Ncould you turn them into me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.98,0:01:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.20,0:01:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Vito, all wrapped up?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.54,0:01:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything is ready to go, Lili.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.04,0:01:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, nice work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.08,0:01:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it's on now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.28,0:01:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This love in my heart,\Nit will burn on forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.14,0:01:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Granting me courage, I\Nhope that we'll never stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.98,0:01:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where you\Nare, nothing is too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.14,0:01:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,With our everlasting bones,\Nwe'll reach it, we are home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.80,0:02:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so truly grateful I ran into\Nyou on that day so long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.58,0:02:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We laughed every moment with tears in\Nour eyes till we knew we weren't alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.26,0:02:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The blowing wind came in\Nand joined us on our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.30,0:02:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And with it I know we'll rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.08,0:02:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be flying up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.84,0:02:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, tell me why are you giving up?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.34,0:02:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, tell me why you wanna fight alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.62,0:02:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what kind of future\Ndo you think you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.64,0:02:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dream is already in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.74,0:02:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This love in my heart,\Nit will burn off forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.90,0:02:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Granting me courage, I\Nhope it will never stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.70,0:02:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And no matter where you\Nare, nothing is too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.84,0:02:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,With our everlasting times\Nwe'll reach and we are home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.60,0:02:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,On the horizon, out on\Nthe edge of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.48,0:02:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a place that\NI want to take you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.52,0:03:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head for it then, but as\Nfor the way, we already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.34,0:03:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We promised it long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.22,0:03:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You scream by your voice that\Ncan't break through the silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.18,0:03:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Feeling defeated, it\Ncrushes your helpless heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.00,0:03:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got your back, I\Nswear, I'll always be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.14,0:03:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's put our fate within\Nthis light under the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.06,0:03:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you close your eyes and\Njust listen to my voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.76,0:03:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's find the answer,\Ntogether I'm telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.42,0:03:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,In our path I trust that it will lead us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.56,0:03:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,To another sea, I'm torn\Nit, cause now we are home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.32,0:03:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,On the horizon, out on\Nthe edge of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.74,0:03:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a place that I wanna take you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.16,0:03:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head forward then,\Nbut ask for the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.84,0:03:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.16,0:04:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We promised it long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.54,0:04:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are these people?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.38,0:04:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And why were they in the cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.40,0:04:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,what a scoop brilliant frankly I've
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.72,0:04:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,become desensitized to\Nthe spectacle oh Oh, no,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.16,0:04:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,this is big news.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.64,0:04:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Look closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.46,0:04:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a pirate from the worst generation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.42,0:04:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.30,0:04:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The unimaginable is happening right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.36,0:04:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He's starting a fight with Big Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.26,0:04:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, there are so many Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.74,0:04:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,They can't all be him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.68,0:04:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.66,0:05:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The cake is collapsing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.50,0:05:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What do they even want?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.98,0:05:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat, Luffy, again?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.26,0:05:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna pay for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.36,0:05:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.14,0:05:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No turning back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.34,0:05:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the big moment. There!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.46,0:05:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on, Mat-dor?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.60,0:05:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought that Straw\NHat Luffy and that other
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.10,0:05:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Gourmet of his died in the prison library.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.46,0:05:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.36,0:05:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Opera, you dunce.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.94,0:05:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you were lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.78,0:05:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Just trying to save your\Nown useless hide, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.48,0:06:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,My cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.76,0:06:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,My precious cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.36,0:06:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.48,0:06:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's ruined!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.78,0:06:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.30,0:06:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,She's acting weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.06,0:06:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I was looking forward to it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.54,0:06:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.78,0:06:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm upset, too, but you\Nhave to keep your composure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.16,0:06:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.00,0:06:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Head chef, you have\Ngot to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.72,0:06:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama's going to freak out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.88,0:06:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I want a cake and you're\Ngoing to bring me a new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.30,0:06:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's impossible. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.84,0:06:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Life...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.84,0:06:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,or...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.75,0:06:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,wedding cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.92,0:07:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.98,0:07:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the soul Pucci!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.96,0:07:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What a scoop!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.00,0:07:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,She's snatching up their life force!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.88,0:07:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone who fears death even a little\Nis vulnerable to this technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.96,0:07:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And who isn't afraid of dying, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.42,0:07:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Look! There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.82,0:07:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't steal my life away, Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.06,0:07:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the price you\Npay for ruining my fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.72,0:07:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Your life is now mine\Nto do with as I please!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.34,0:07:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.54,0:07:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You enjoyed that cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.26,0:08:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard a loud yell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.36,0:08:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Mom's really freaking\Nout—is this part of their plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.22,0:08:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Our plan's gone off the\Nrails too hard to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.64,0:08:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If this chaos will help or\Nnot, I swear you're gonna pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.98,0:08:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,pay
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.94,0:08:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Pedro, have you sent them all?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.72,0:08:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This Luffy is the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.96,0:08:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to cause some chaos\Nourselves, friend. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.40,0:08:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.10,0:08:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Sanji could use some backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.42,0:08:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.36,0:08:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Got your earplugs? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.48,0:08:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm totally screen-proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.14,0:08:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And we're supposed to\Nrescue Sanji's family.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.10,0:08:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.01,0:08:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, we'll leave the rest to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.94,0:08:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't screw this up, loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.48,0:08:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he really that bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.68,0:08:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.62,0:08:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I get my heart back,\NI'll teach them a lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.44,0:09:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I have had all I can stand of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.70,0:09:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Wretched little pest!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.04,0:09:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.62,0:09:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat, which one is you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.02,0:09:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, monkey dear Yuffie, now\Nthat I know who you are, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.96,0:09:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's have a chat in the new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.66,0:09:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're making stupid excuses, big mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.94,0:09:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't become king of\Nthe pirates and that's on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.24,0:09:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Get over here and fight me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.50,0:09:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not backing down even\Nif you are an emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.84,0:09:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm taking sonja back no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.62,0:10:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna turn this all\Naround and make you sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.94,0:10:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The perfect cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.08,0:10:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It just collapsed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.84,0:10:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.74,0:10:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.22,0:10:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you ruin the wedding cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.46,0:10:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Which one of you is real? Show yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.62,0:10:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you, Squat?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.12,0:10:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What, are you stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.00,0:10:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would he do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.80,0:10:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll murder you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.58,0:10:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Get over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.76,0:11:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This is obviously a diversion.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.06,0:11:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not going to respond to you, moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.48,0:11:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm right over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.02,0:11:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.96,0:11:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He responded!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.08,0:11:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If you wanna fight, then you got one!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.98,0:11:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tear you limb from limb!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.12,0:11:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.24,0:11:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There's the photo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.04,0:12:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido, Vito, got that\Nlauncher ready, I hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.56,0:12:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.74,0:12:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready to go, Lili, at any time. Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.70,0:12:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Straw Hat, don't screw this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.88,0:12:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go, you awful beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.08,0:12:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,They're coming in hordes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.98,0:12:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.80,0:12:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That one must be the real Luffy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.44,0:12:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Lay low till he breaks the picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.60,0:12:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we wait three seconds and move.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.74,0:12:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, this is serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.46,0:12:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you even listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.98,0:12:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you hearing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.94,0:12:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Zeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.70,0:12:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.76,0:12:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Prometheus!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.78,0:12:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready to shine!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.00,0:12:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna take out the\Nwhole crowd in one shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.16,0:12:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.08,0:12:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Too easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.52,0:12:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Now suck on this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.36,0:12:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.74,0:13:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.24,0:13:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.36,0:13:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the real one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.50,0:13:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The other Straw Hats are animals that\Nwere transformed by Brulé's ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.10,0:13:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have gathered them\Nin the seducing woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.88,0:13:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't pay them any mind. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.48,0:13:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, they must\Nhave captured Barrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.94,0:13:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.18,0:13:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this somebody's power?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.26,0:13:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,My arms and legs are stuck in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.52,0:13:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this weird thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.34,0:13:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Katakuri, are you trying to save me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.98,0:13:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're my son,\Nbut I can handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.04,0:13:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not it, mama; he's not after you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.82,0:13:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He's after mother, Carmel's portrait!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.08,0:13:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But how do you know the\Nimportance of that portrait?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.60,0:14:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Only people close to the family\Nshould have that information.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.82,0:14:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Spit it out. Who told you? Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.02,0:14:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me out, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.56,0:14:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, ain't this a fine mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.38,0:14:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody, anybody, break\Nthat picture, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.52,0:14:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Lupe!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.68,0:14:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.86,0:14:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me, Pedro!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.06,0:14:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.08,0:14:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Full shot current!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.94,0:14:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoulder throw!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.32,0:14:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.24,0:14:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Going to explain my powers now, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.02,0:14:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.30,0:15:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Katakuri wields the power of the Mochi\NMochi fruit, a parametheotide like yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.16,0:15:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinbei!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.22,0:15:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You can get away from its hold with\Nliquid, but better to stay away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.12,0:15:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.80,0:15:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Just to be clear, I'm the one who\Ntold Luffy about Mother Carmel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.88,0:15:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,As your ally, I heard\Nrumors of certain incidents.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.84,0:15:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Bunch of miscreants!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.40,0:15:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Did they come to take back Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.80,0:15:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They really think they can\Nescape here with their lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.56,0:15:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And the wedding's ruined at any rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.94,0:15:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll be damned.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.06,0:15:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought Straw Hat was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.90,0:15:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, members\Nof the Vinsmoke family.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.56,0:15:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The Charlotte siblings shall take care\Nof this little matter lickety-split.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.18,0:15:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Lick.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.02,0:15:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.86,0:15:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you said you wouldn't\Nbe leaving our alliance,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.34,0:15:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,and yet you defended the little\Ninterlover who ruined my cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.76,0:16:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,To be clear, am I to interpret\Nthis as an outright mutiny? Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.26,0:16:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That is a fair assessment\Nof the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.38,0:16:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.29,0:16:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got some nerve.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.16,0:16:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,As of now, I am departing your crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.98,0:16:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,...because it is my intention\Nto join the Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.62,0:16:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I call big news!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.94,0:16:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The former warlord Jinbei wants\Nto join the Straw Hat Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.26,0:16:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, fine then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.12,0:16:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,After you leave, you can do as you choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.18,0:16:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you recall our previous talk,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.62,0:16:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,you still need to pay the\Nprice before I let you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.40,0:16:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, you would be betraying the\Ngenerosity I showed you. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.04,0:17:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So long as you promise me that no harm\Nwill come to the rest of the Sun Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.30,0:17:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,As for my own lifespan, I'll gladly\Noffer up as much as you can take.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.84,0:17:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinbei!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.75,0:17:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Your plan doesn't make sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.04,0:17:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you join my crew if you die?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.26,0:17:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I get my treat after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.82,0:17:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's such a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.58,0:17:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You really hate me that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.94,0:17:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to leave this paradise\NI've worked so hard to build.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.62,0:17:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it kills you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.30,0:17:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you won't get my pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.16,0:17:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,She's gonna use the soul focus again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.00,0:17:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.14,0:17:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You know how the deal works?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.78,0:17:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So what will it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.24,0:17:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.68,0:17:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Or life!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.92,0:17:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Make your choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.62,0:18:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I choose life!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.36,0:18:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.88,0:18:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, he's done for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.20,0:18:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The death of Jimei!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.02,0:18:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What a scoop!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.06,0:18:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.26,0:18:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I said stay or life!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.68,0:18:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,His soul won't budge.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.98,0:18:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.24,0:18:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.54,0:18:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That means he's not afraid\Nof Mama's power even a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.48,0:18:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you think I would falter?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.72,0:18:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The man who I have chosen to follow will\Nsurely be king of the pirates someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.86,0:19:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't be intimidated by\Na mere emperor of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.16,0:19:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,She can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.94,0:19:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,She can't take away Jinbei's lifespan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.00,0:19:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can't pay you in spirit,\Nthen I shall return this sake cup.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.26,0:19:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,My pledge renounced?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.10,0:19:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I now officially depart\Nfrom the Big Mom Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.62,0:19:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I thank you for the generosity\Nthat you've shown me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.06,0:19:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,All this chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.86,0:20:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And he just cuts right through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.64,0:20:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe how awesome he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.86,0:20:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.74,0:20:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.86,0:20:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.82,0:20:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.36,0:20:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma ma ma ma!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.32,0:20:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Jinbei!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.66,0:20:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You've made a powerful enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.50,0:20:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you're happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.60,0:20:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Chop!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.46,0:21:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the portrait of Mother Carmel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.18,0:21:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He just destroyed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.86,0:21:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.84,0:21:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that is some big news.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.18,0:21:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.68,0:21:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.94,0:21:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.86,0:21:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice work!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.22,0:21:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.80,0:21:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So one of those fake Straw Hats\Nwasn't an animal after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.84,0:21:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.54,0:21:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Mom saw the busted portrait.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.54,0:21:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a few seconds before\Nshe blows her wig. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.10,0:22:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He's acting odd. What the devil?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.78,0:22:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We have the deadly poison\NK-X Launcher's ready to fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.68,0:22:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He ripped the skin off his own face?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.42,0:22:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.68,0:22:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my face!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.08,0:22:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He's so freaky!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.46,0:22:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So, King, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.06,0:22:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.44,0:22:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you died.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.34,0:22:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.68,0:22:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But it was years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.00,0:22:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.78,0:22:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know who that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.46,0:22:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.46,0:22:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.38,0:22:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,My picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.12,0:22:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,My picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.68,0:22:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh poor mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.42,0:22:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on isn't\Nshe supposed to yell!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.90,0:23:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.50,0:23:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,This has happened before!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.24,0:23:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama's gonna go crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.24,0:23:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea\Nwhat you've done here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.30,0:23:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And you monsters have destroyed\Nmy lovely wedding cake too?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.86,0:23:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I see what's happening here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.80,0:23:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama's in shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.92,0:23:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,She's gonna go mad—let's kill\NStraw Hat before it gets ugly!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.74,0:23:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.00,0:23:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We must stand firm until Big Mom\Nbegins to scream and panic. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.28,0:23:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.32,0:23:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,die Oh, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.16,0:23:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.34,0:23:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.25,0:23:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It definitely hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.36,0:24:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Pudding?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.30,0:24:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's find someplace safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.10,0:24:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Pudding, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.70,0:24:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Be quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.14,0:24:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.46,0:24:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the real me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.34,0:24:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,See? You surprised?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.24,0:24:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.50,0:24:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to worry, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.90,0:24:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't have to live with the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.68,0:25:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been conning idiots\Nlike you my entire life.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.80,0:25:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so easy to deceive.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.44,0:25:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.22,0:25:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.78,0:25:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What I mean is, you've also been\Ndeceiving yourself, Pudding, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.56,0:25:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.12,0:25:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What would you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.34,0:25:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't have to play. You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.14,0:25:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Drop it, Pudding. Back off!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.82,0:25:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Pudding.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.42,0:25:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Please tell me you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.04,0:26:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You screwed this one up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.40,0:26:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You useless twit!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.70,0:26:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have time to\Nscrew around like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.54,0:26:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Things can't proceed to this chunk dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.04,0:26:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.06,0:26:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,GD, come on out!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.42,0:26:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,GD!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.34,0:26:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.42,0:26:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Dyefunko, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.26,0:26:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec, I promise that\NI can finish the job, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.50,0:26:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You already had your chance\Nand completely blew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.02,0:26:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Now take a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.94,0:27:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on, Pudding!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.48,0:27:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over, Collier Spray!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.64,0:27:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough already!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.08,0:27:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't use my power anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.20,0:27:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Please I beg you my heart\Nis on the line. I'll have no
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.90,0:27:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys don't give up, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.32,0:27:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your Put a sock in\Nit and head of security,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.80,0:27:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,remember they'll catch on if I sit back.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.82,0:27:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I've captured a captain—great kill! him?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.38,0:27:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,him
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.86,0:28:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, that ain't a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.84,0:28:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop messing around!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.86,0:28:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Just shut up. Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.62,0:28:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We hit a snag.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.10,0:28:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What's keeping Big Mom from screaming?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.16,0:28:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stall much longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.42,0:28:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, Jinbei! Oven?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.90,0:28:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you'll pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.64,0:28:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful, Pedro.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.04,0:28:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let him make contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.12,0:28:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,With you, what the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.78,0:28:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.30,0:28:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,remember you,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.24,0:28:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Pedro.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.38,0:28:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You were Peckham's brother\Nin arms, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.84,0:28:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If I recall correctly, you lost your\Neye and a chunk of your life when you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.22,0:28:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You miserably failed to\Nsteal Mama's poli-glyph.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.60,0:29:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,By daring to show your face here again,\NI can only assume you're ready to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.22,0:29:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.13,0:29:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always been ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.22,0:29:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna cook you alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.30,0:29:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been three seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.06,0:29:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How long do we wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.24,0:29:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What is the hold-up?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.22,0:29:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't Big Mom supposed\Nto be yelling right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.94,0:29:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.24,0:29:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.44,0:29:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I mean, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.80,0:29:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.18,0:29:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't know you could pop your head off.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.60,0:30:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy: We need to get back to the matter\Nat hand, what the blazes is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.12,0:30:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you try\Nsomething like this on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.82,0:30:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry veggie, get off of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.98,0:30:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it—this wasn't supposed to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.10,0:30:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,happen What is the\Nmeaning of this big mob?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.94,0:30:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I trusted you!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.56,0:30:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You're licked.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.20,0:30:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What about our agreement?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.54,0:30:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Even in the underworld, we are a decency.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.84,0:30:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.88,0:30:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,A little late to whine\Nabout it now, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.00,0:30:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We sure walked into this one, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.78,0:30:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This candy has us bound.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.90,0:30:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,They swiped all our weapons at the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.34,0:30:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,They even have our raid suits.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.58,0:30:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like we fell for the perfect setup.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.24,0:30:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess we aimed too high, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.26,0:31:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What is wrong with you? Stop laughing!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.02,0:31:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate to say it, but you're the\None who made your sons this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.32,0:31:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.74,0:31:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't even fear their own death.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.40,0:31:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,They may be my brothers, but I\Ncan hardly even see them as human.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.54,0:31:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.30,0:31:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,As far as assassinations\Ngo, this is quite sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.50,0:31:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like I'm just squashing a bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.22,0:31:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Utter cruelty.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.68,0:31:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you tongue-tied, judge?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.68,0:31:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You're making jokes?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.14,0:31:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I've worked so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.14,0:31:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I've devoted my life to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.92,0:31:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,All for the sake of vengeance against\Nthe countries of the North Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.54,0:31:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I've shed blood, sweat, and\Ntears for the Jeremiah Empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.24,0:31:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.50,0:32:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you have to say for yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.26,0:32:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.06,0:32:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What a miserable sight you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.18,0:32:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.46,0:32:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Jerma's gonna get wiped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.92,0:32:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh-ho, the news just doesn't stop today.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.66,0:32:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Jerma's leader's bawling his eyes out.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.40,0:32:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Please tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.38,0:32:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all a lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.16,0:32:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't even bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.40,0:32:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama's in a state of shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.18,0:32:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wasting your breath\Ntrying to get through to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.50,0:32:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I admit when Mother Carmel's portrait\Nshattered, I felt a knot in my stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.56,0:32:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But it seems that Mama's anger\Npushed her over the edge,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.88,0:32:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,so in a sense we're in lickety luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.12,0:33:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I do understand your burning ambition\Nand delusions of grandeur, Judge.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.66,0:33:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Lickety.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.32,0:33:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But think of it this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.24,0:33:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you listen to a cattle's plea when\Nyou've been looking forward to a steak?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.82,0:33:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we consume, you will be unstoppable.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.08,0:33:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,All thanks to Germa.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.14,0:33:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to go help them out!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.50,0:33:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, wait. Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.52,0:33:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Tread carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.20,0:33:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Mom is having an emotional overload\Nand doesn't know what to focus on first.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.68,0:33:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we should show her\Nthe broken picture again.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.68,0:33:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, if you say so, that's\Nwhat we'll do, buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.46,0:33:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That ship is sailed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.28,0:33:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.86,0:33:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That tall guy from before is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.46,0:33:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Katakuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.62,0:33:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, change your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.78,0:34:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking that approach will work
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.90,0:34:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Katakuri's looking pale as a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.36,0:34:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.52,0:34:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It means he saw a future\Nwhere the things get messy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.62,0:34:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Do your thing, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.86,0:34:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Just leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.28,0:34:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinbei! Pedro! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.66,0:34:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta back Straw\NHat up with all we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.06,0:34:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.96,0:34:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Allied Forces!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.40,0:34:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has come!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.94,0:34:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Equip your Invisible Symphonia!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.78,0:34:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Invisible Symphonia?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.44,0:34:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The Airflags!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.18,0:34:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Buggy?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.24,0:34:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he shouting about? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.48,0:34:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you pull it off?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.22,0:34:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's our last shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.84,0:34:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And the only way we can take\Neveryone out simultaneously!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.14,0:34:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Buggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.18,0:35:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What's taking so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.98,0:35:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot Straw Hat
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.20,0:35:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm good, Paulie.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.96,0:35:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it! Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.98,0:35:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So all I gotta do is show Big Mom this\Nthing Everything will be back on track,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.74,0:35:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.92,0:35:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Flambeau shot go!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.90,0:35:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You can only peep slightly ahead, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.94,0:35:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, ain't that a pity?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.96,0:35:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But that ain't some special\Nprivilege, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.96,0:36:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if we can't see it ourselves,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.32,0:36:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,we all have an equal right\Nto change the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.14,0:36:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hehehehe.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.60,0:36:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, strut.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.78,0:36:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha, ha, ha.
